  "texts": [
    {
      "spokenText": "Alors je dis : « Si c'est possible, je préférerais seulement l'entrée et le dessert. »",
      "textSHA256": "dc51f7592eec9812fe09f4d99c67eb23bce8c7fd967609d25391f8d07983d118",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:25:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Aujourd'hui, c'est un jour férié et le restaurant ne sert qu'un menu fixe.",
      "textSHA256": "d28911087b8b40b3cd05dbd84706f7ede3971b15c3beb83e61519c21b434071d",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:25:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Comme je n'ai pas très faim, je lui demande : « Y a-t-il une option plus légère ? »",
      "textSHA256": "57591bb823df1487d956164784b9333b1becf80c2634f6a3bcfada6eebb0ed73",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:25:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Ensuite, je demande : « Ça coûte combien par personne ? »",
      "textSHA256": "0068cb096e1b04351d1c759e0a68af00d69cb348fe86777bee95f224aae760ec",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:25:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 4
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Entrée et dessert pour 25 euros, d'accord.",
      "textSHA256": "63b68493e708d1d41cde3af4fd8f604d5206da07a6f0b4a457e0d9b6a4b94e15",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:25:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 23
        },
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:25:fr-en",
          "surface": "speaking-closure"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Il explique que le menu comprend une entrée, un plat principal, un dessert et une boisson.",
      "textSHA256": "030c5a12534e2589ef6a49fc49a6436dd6259cd8dc55126d0df33c27e5352905",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:25:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Il répond que je peux commander une demi-portion du plat principal, mais que le prix ne change pas.",
      "textSHA256": "c8c924faaaa4b76c0659466551e34cbe1997a4f5483302f942c44dddcb21c71a",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:25:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 7
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Il y a un supplément de 3 euros pour le café.",
      "textSHA256": "622df462b9e3b14c82dc9ce4b4585702f62b51849e6eaacb16531e8e8f7a0706",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:25:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 19
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je demande au serveur : « Que comprend le menu fixe ? »",
      "textSHA256": "d858242c8c9dcb9650820d2d76b73117bc9d5c5c4d58e6a7701a2a8b2aecb951",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:25:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je n'ai pas très faim.",
      "textSHA256": "a036978c767a701368c5c54cca43d390796f8bdb9b38f922362c1630bff834ea",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:25:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 17
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "La boisson est-elle comprise dans le prix ?",
      "textSHA256": "68b11b57958800480d999f8c26eb6fde70393b18b51d6a63f1405e0b97cfd8e5",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:25:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 15
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Le menu est à 45 euros par personne.",
      "textSHA256": "02dab9640a22b0d9674602acd41e4fce5618ad7b2d60ca61b4ed5efd73383f95",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:25:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 20
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Le prix ne change pas.",
      "textSHA256": "d8df921fb8ca7f086aa617578436dfbf1c9101ad49ed661001b3d2048ead53c1",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:25:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 21
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Le serveur dit que le prix par personne est de 45 euros et qu’il y a un supplément de 3 euros pour le café.",
      "textSHA256": "af8e3bcd0541d798902d334ff2da952047aa90ac8586437e32d578e3b9f0c66c",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:25:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Le serveur vérifie auprès du chef et accepte de nous le faire à 25 euros.",
      "textSHA256": "ad7aaf29f8d9d6fe9ce888fd8bc13227eae474f98ed290d6876332ada596e2a5",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:25:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 9
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Pourriez-vous demander au chef, s'il vous plaît ?",
      "textSHA256": "c8d1722ba920995e5785f4651aa5914912d166c42ebac2d108a57762fd4c09ff",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:25:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 22
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Puis-je commander une demi-portion du plat principal ?",
      "textSHA256": "74469d582a9887e387cd8f57423e774c890174d44ce61489c79d6762f9afdb0a",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:25:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 18
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Que comprend le menu fixe ?",
      "textSHA256": "f94c9991d175df1f7604c4c6531e1f65a9e1b0c25eb65e57e7ab15db1cd13917",
      "placements": [
